DESCRIPTION:The beloved children’s tale “The Story of Peter Rabbit” comes to life in the form of “Mini Música” —an interactive\, bilingual story time concert for young audiences ages 0 to 7. Featuring a 16-piece orchestra and a narrator who dances and sings in English and Spanish\, this program is designed to engage young children through a musical telling of a classic children’s story. As part of the Colorado Symphony’s commitment to early childhood education literacy initiatives\, all concert attendees will receive a complimentary bilingual storybook at each concert.\nLearn more and make free reservations online at https://longmontcolorado.gov/event/colorado-symphony-mini-musica-concert-the-story-of-peter-rabbit/ or by calling 303-651-8374.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/colorado-symphony-mini-musica-concert-the-story-of-peter-rabbit
